ues [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]five beads at a time until no open task beads remain.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]1[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] wave[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]backlog_batch_a1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/backlog_batch_a1.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-d7[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-d7/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Skip the snapshot store test when note-profile LaTeX packages [bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]are missing[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]snapshot-test-gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot-test-gate: move the note-profile package skip helper into [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared test support, gate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]store_snapshot_create_records_note_snapshot_route and any other ungated [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]real snapshot render with it, and close bob-cli-d6.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop pandoc numbering headings the author already numbered[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]manual-heading-numbers[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]manual-heading-numbers: teach the number_from_top_level Lua pass to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]leave self-numbered Markdown documents unnumbered but listed, cover it [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with filter tests and a scratch render, update [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/highlights-create.md, and close bob-cli-58.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make the completion PTY and zpty tests load-tolerant[/bold #D7AFFF] 